      "content": "Because you are expressing thoughts of giving up, I need to urge you to reach out for immediate support right now. Please connect with a crisis line like the National Suicide Prevention Lifeline at 988, or text HOME to 741741. These trained professionals are there to listen without judgment and help you navigate these overwhelming feelings. Your life has value, and there is support available to carry this pain with you.",
